      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Good work, stalker! This is exactly what we need. Well, Marked One, you carried out my request to the letter, and in return you can take this suit as a small sample of our appreciation. I think you'll like it. This is just the tip of the iceberg, our Duty boys always carry the best kit, all paid for by us. This privilege could also extend to you. You've proven yourself to be a capable operator, and we need men like you to do us proud. Therefore, I would like to make you the offer of joining our ranks officially. You'll never want for food, shelter, equipment and good company again, not when you're wearing Duty colors. \\n \\nWhat do you say, stalker? Ready to take the oath? ",
      "JA_current": "Good work, stalker! This is exactly what we need. Well, Marked One, you carried out my request to the letter, and in return you can take this suit as a small sample of our appreciation. I think you'll like it. This is just the tip of the iceberg, our Duty boys always carry the best kit, all paid for by us. This privilege could also extend to you. You've proven yourself to be a capable operator, and we need men like you to do us proud. Therefore, I would like to make you the offer of joining our ranks officially. You'll never want for food, shelter, equipment and good company again, not when you're wearing Duty colors. \\n \\nWhat do you say, stalker? Ready to take the oath? ",
