      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Good man! Repeat after me: \"I, a stalker known as Marked One, swear to defend the goals and ideals of Duty.\"",
      "JA_current": "よろしい！ 復唱しろ： 「私、Marked One と名乗るストーカーは、Duty の目標と理念を守ると誓う」。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
